==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|fr}} {{m|frm|peau}}, from {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{m|fro|pel}}, from {{etyl|la|fr}} {{m|la|pellis}}, ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|fr}} {{m|ine-pro|*pel-||to cover, wrap; skin, hide; cloth}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/po/|lang=fr}}
* {{audio|Fr-peau.ogg|Audio (France, Paris)|lang=fr}}
* {{audio|Fr-BE-la peau.ogg|Audio (Belgium)|lang=fr}}
* {{homophones|pau|paux|peaux|Pô|pot|pots|lang=fr}}
* {{rhymes|o|lang=fr}}

===Noun===
{{fr-noun|f|peaux}}

# [[skin]] of a person or animal
# [[hide]], [[fur]]
# [[skin]] (protective outer layer of a plant or fruit)
# [[pellicule]] formed on top of certain prepared foods

